WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.600 --> 01:46.759
=Episode 12=

01:48.080 --> 01:50.030
(Zhengwu Alliance)

01:57.080 --> 01:58.840
Qiyuan Sect is really wicked.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.640
The ones who got fooled
are also foolish.

02:02.150 --> 02:05.640
They're so naive to think
worshiping could get things easy.

02:07.180 --> 02:08.490
(Yongwu Hall disciples)
Qiming,

02:08.490 --> 02:10.199
(Xu Qiming, Chen Qianjun)
Head Ju has come back.

02:10.199 --> 02:13.040
I saw him, Qianjun.
Among the Zhengwu Alliance's Heads,

02:13.040 --> 02:16.480
he's the only one
who hasn't fought and won.

02:16.480 --> 02:18.750
Right, he doesn't deserve
to be the Head.

02:20.030 --> 02:21.590
I thought Jiqiao Hall is long gone.

02:21.590 --> 02:22.640
Qianjun, Qiming.

02:25.000 --> 02:28.170
Shifang is our fellow and the Head.
Don't be rude.

02:28.800 --> 02:30.230
Yes, Head Wen.

02:30.230 --> 02:31.310
Get lost.

02:35.320 --> 02:36.360
Shifang.

02:36.360 --> 02:37.420
Yang.

02:39.070 --> 02:42.680
It has been a long time.
I need to visit Lv Dazhi now.

02:42.680 --> 02:44.430
You take good care of the guests.

02:44.430 --> 02:45.840
I'll buy you drinks when I get back.

02:47.310 --> 02:48.400
I'd take my leave.

02:51.500 --> 02:52.560
Shifang.

02:53.079 --> 02:54.760
This man seems
quite generous and righteous.

02:55.790 --> 02:58.590
As Yongwu Hall's Head, Yang is friendly,

02:59.400 --> 03:02.080
and he is also my best friend
in Zhengwu Alliance.

03:02.080 --> 03:05.470
Xu Qiming and Chen Qianjun
are from his hall.

03:06.870 --> 03:09.440
Shifang, how many people
are there in your Jiqiao Hall?

03:11.470 --> 03:13.470
I'm the only one right now.

03:16.760 --> 03:20.720
That means few people are
good at making mechanism these days.

03:20.720 --> 03:22.720
Shifang, I think you're amazing.

03:23.230 --> 03:24.720
Thank you, Little Yue.

03:24.720 --> 03:25.870
Let's go.

03:25.870 --> 03:26.990
Let's go.

03:27.640 --> 03:29.150
Your Zhengwu Alliance seems...

03:29.680 --> 03:32.460
How's it? It's pretty good.

03:32.460 --> 03:33.470
Pretty good.

03:33.470 --> 03:34.600
Over there, up ahead.

03:34.600 --> 03:35.660
Up ahead?

03:35.660 --> 03:36.750
Hurry up.

03:40.150 --> 03:43.470
Zhaoyan, it has been a long time.
We miss you so much.

03:44.230 --> 03:45.260
So do I.

03:46.079 --> 03:47.910
It seems Zhaoyan doesn't miss us.

03:51.079 --> 03:52.520
Senior, you still like to joke.

03:53.310 --> 03:55.280
Luo, why weren't you there?

03:55.280 --> 03:57.000
I heard the disturbance outside earlier,

03:57.000 --> 03:58.750
but I'm not a member
of the Zhengwu Alliance,

03:58.750 --> 03:59.950
so I waited here.

04:00.720 --> 04:02.520
I didn't expect such a thing to happen.

04:03.720 --> 04:05.160
We must eliminate
Qiyuan Sect right away.

04:06.800 --> 04:08.360
Welcome to the Zhengwu Alliance.

04:11.910 --> 04:14.440
Ming Xiu, how's your master?

04:15.750 --> 04:17.910
Thank you for your concern,
he is all well.

04:19.750 --> 04:22.750
Alliance Leader, they are my friends
I mentioned in the letter.

04:23.910 --> 04:27.190
Little Yue, Jinzhao,
and Senior Xian Qing.

04:27.950 --> 04:30.750
I have known you three
from the letters of Shifang.

04:31.470 --> 04:35.470
Recently, I've also heard
of your heroic deeds from Master Luo.

04:35.470 --> 04:38.030
It's an honor to meet you today.

04:39.390 --> 04:40.520
You flatter us.

04:42.640 --> 04:43.690
Shifang.

04:45.360 --> 04:49.000
You've been gone for so long
and just sent only two letters.

04:51.950 --> 04:53.159
I'm sorry, Alliance Leader.

04:53.830 --> 04:57.520
Alliance Leader Zuo, Shifang
has been helping us on this journey.

04:57.520 --> 05:01.470
Right. We destroyed stronghold
of Qiyuan Sect in Luori Village.

05:01.470 --> 05:03.030
Shifang has indeed
made a great contribution.

05:03.880 --> 05:04.880
Really?

05:07.190 --> 05:10.720
It seems Shifang has made great progress
on this journey.

05:17.640 --> 05:22.550
Please try the iced plum soup,
which is a specialty in Jing'an

05:22.550 --> 05:25.520
and perfect for relieving the heat.
Please enjoy.

05:28.830 --> 05:29.880
Refreshing.

05:29.880 --> 05:30.920
Take it slow.

05:32.640 --> 05:35.360
Miss Yue,
if you like it, you can have...

05:35.360 --> 05:36.430
Another bowl.

05:37.190 --> 05:38.440
You're being impolite.

05:40.190 --> 05:41.320
- Here you are.
- Thank you.

05:44.720 --> 05:46.390
I haven't been back for a long time.

05:46.390 --> 05:48.600
I really miss this flavor.

05:49.950 --> 05:53.080
In that case,
you should stay here a little longer.

05:54.310 --> 05:58.390
I mean... Hey, I want another bowl too.

05:58.390 --> 06:01.630
I learned from Shifang's letter
you are also investigating Qiyuan Sect.

06:03.440 --> 06:05.830
Alliance Leader Zuo, Qiyuan Sect
has committed many evil deeds.

06:06.440 --> 06:08.000
It's our job to get rid of them.

06:08.600 --> 06:11.670
Yue, I have informed Alliance Leader Zuo
about the matter of Bian Luohuan.

06:12.480 --> 06:15.720
Zhengwu Alliance and Qiyuan Sect
have been fighting for a long time,

06:17.000 --> 06:20.600
but we've never had a clue
about their Didact.

06:21.440 --> 06:22.920
Yue, don't get discouraged.

06:24.110 --> 06:26.550
We've been receiving

06:26.550 --> 06:29.720
a lot of anonymous information
from heroes in recent days.

06:29.720 --> 06:31.350
With these clues,

06:31.350 --> 06:35.230
we wiped out the stronghold
of Jiangning branch of Qiyuan Sect.

06:36.200 --> 06:40.630
The sect leader of Qiyuan Sect was
inspecting there, so we killed him too.

06:41.920 --> 06:44.720
Besides, I have a crystal

06:45.350 --> 06:49.950
found by the Master Luo
from Luori Village's stronghold.

06:51.000 --> 06:53.630
Unfortunately, we don't know its origin.

06:53.630 --> 06:55.480
Do any of you might have a clue?

06:55.480 --> 06:56.880
(Isn't it the crystal
from Wuyan Village?)

06:57.390 --> 06:58.670
(How did it end up in Luori Village?)

06:59.440 --> 07:02.000
(I might trade the information
about the crystal for a favor,)

07:02.670 --> 07:05.830
(so I could ask the Zhengwu Alliance
to help us investigate our origins.)

07:05.830 --> 07:10.280
Qi, doesn't this crystal look like
the one we saw in Wuyan Village?

07:11.440 --> 07:15.040
Right. I remember when I woke up,

07:15.040 --> 07:17.200
I think I've seen this crystal.

07:17.200 --> 07:20.280
Alliance Leader Zuo, we've lived
in Wuyan Village for a while.

07:20.790 --> 07:22.670
Since this crystal
is related to Wuyan Village,

07:23.230 --> 07:26.950
if you don't mind,
we could go to investigate it.

07:26.950 --> 07:28.510
Luo, do you think so?

07:29.040 --> 07:30.190
Of course.

07:32.230 --> 07:35.630
Good, then I shall await the good news.

07:36.630 --> 07:39.070
Since you have come to Jing'an,

07:39.070 --> 07:42.320
if you need anything, just tell Shifang.

07:43.110 --> 07:44.140
Yes.

07:50.350 --> 07:52.630
Come in, this is my Jiqiao Hall.

07:53.390 --> 07:56.720
Shifang, your Jiqiao Hall looks so nice.

07:58.040 --> 07:59.550
Shifang, what is this?

08:01.440 --> 08:03.000
It's for measuring the wind power.

08:03.000 --> 08:05.200
What's the use of it?

08:05.200 --> 08:07.040
Of course, it is of great use.

08:08.950 --> 08:11.830
Measuring the wind power would be useful

08:11.830 --> 08:13.720
in war and farming.

08:14.320 --> 08:15.920
Zhaoyan, you are amazing.

08:15.920 --> 08:19.040
Right, I have a lot of
useful stuff in my room.

08:19.040 --> 08:20.070
I'll show you.

08:20.720 --> 08:23.160
Let's go. Here.

08:32.549 --> 08:34.600
This is my room. Feel free to visit.

08:37.320 --> 08:39.390
I've never seen a room like this.

08:43.950 --> 08:46.480
Don't touch it!
This is my defense mechanism.

08:46.480 --> 08:47.510
Don't touch it recklessly.

08:47.510 --> 08:49.040
The rest is free to visit.

08:49.670 --> 08:52.600
Shifang is really
passionate about mechanisms.

08:52.600 --> 08:53.920
More than that,

08:54.480 --> 08:57.230
he even wants to take
these wooden mechanisms as food.

08:58.280 --> 09:00.600
The mechanism
comes from inner inspiration.

09:00.600 --> 09:03.390
One day I will show the world
the benefits of them.

09:03.390 --> 09:07.480
Yes, you have to promote them.

09:08.230 --> 09:09.670
Thank you, Jinzhao.

09:09.670 --> 09:10.720
Senior.

09:10.720 --> 09:11.820
Thank you.

09:15.950 --> 09:18.480
Zhaoyan, have some tea.

09:22.480 --> 09:23.630
Thank you, Senior.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.550
You've been in Jing'an for days.

09:28.320 --> 09:29.790
Do you have any good scenes
to recommend?

09:30.790 --> 09:33.830
I've been here these days
and didn't go sightseeing.

09:33.830 --> 09:35.830
Senior, you might as well ask Shifang.

09:37.350 --> 09:38.880
Yes, Senior Xian Qing.

09:38.880 --> 09:41.000
If there's anything
you want to know about Jing'an,

09:41.000 --> 09:42.190
you can just ask me.

09:43.670 --> 09:46.390
Everyone, I am a bit tired
and want to take some rest.

09:56.040 --> 09:57.130
Thank you, Shifang.

09:58.040 --> 10:01.160
But now it is hot, I'll take a nap.

10:05.200 --> 10:09.510
Jinzhao, why do Senior Xian Qing
and Zhaoyan seem a bit weird?

10:17.480 --> 10:20.800
Can't you see
that Senior Xian Qing likes Zhaoyan?

10:23.070 --> 10:26.510
Luo and Senior Xian Qing are both men.

10:27.190 --> 10:28.510
It's impossible.

10:30.070 --> 10:32.800
So does Senior Xian Qing like Luo?

10:34.190 --> 10:35.340
Of course.

10:38.430 --> 10:40.510
This is how Zhaoyan sees Xian Qing.

10:46.310 --> 10:48.720
And this is
how Senior Xian Qing sees Zhaoyan.

10:58.800 --> 11:03.920
So it's the unrequited love
described in the storybooks?

11:06.950 --> 11:09.800
W-W-Well, this is terrible.

11:09.800 --> 11:10.800
Nothing terrible.

11:11.560 --> 11:13.070
Are you hungry?
I'll take you for some snacks.

11:15.240 --> 11:16.360
I'll take you.

11:16.360 --> 11:17.450
You take care of the mechanisms.

11:18.160 --> 11:19.500
- Let's go.
- Go to have snacks.

11:19.500 --> 11:22.040
Right, then you take Little Yue
for some delicious food.

11:22.100 --> 11:24.000
(Jing'an)

11:25.550 --> 11:26.960
- Here, miss.
- Thank you.

11:27.950 --> 11:29.950
Owner, I would like
water-chestnut cake, osmanthus cake,

11:29.950 --> 11:32.390
sesame candy, chestnut pastry,
and cherry blossom custard.

11:32.390 --> 11:35.430
Miss, eating too many sweets
would harm you.

11:35.430 --> 11:36.990
But I want to eat them all.

11:38.560 --> 11:39.660
I'll have one of each.

11:41.480 --> 11:43.510
Jinzhao, I also want
to drink that plum soup.

11:45.870 --> 11:47.630
Do you think we still have money?

11:49.070 --> 11:50.120
Yes.

11:50.720 --> 11:53.190
Miss, please wait,
I'll get some wrap paper.

11:59.480 --> 12:00.520
Zhu.

12:02.310 --> 12:04.490
Zhu, I've finally found you, Zhu.

12:04.490 --> 12:05.550
Who are you?

12:06.160 --> 12:07.630
Let's go. I'll make you
something delicious.

12:08.160 --> 12:09.240
- Who are you?
- Take care.

12:09.240 --> 12:10.480
I don't know you.

12:10.480 --> 12:11.830
- Qi.
- Come on, Zhu.

12:11.830 --> 12:12.990
What's the matter?

12:12.990 --> 12:14.040
She grabbed me.

12:14.040 --> 12:16.590
Sorry, both of you, I'm sorry.

12:16.590 --> 12:17.830
- This is my wife.
- Zhu.

12:17.830 --> 12:20.160
Because we just lost
our daughter a while ago,

12:20.160 --> 12:22.630
my wife couldn't withstand the shock
and lost her mind.

12:22.630 --> 12:25.800
So upon seeing a girl at her age,
she would mistake her for Zhu.

12:25.800 --> 12:27.240
I'm sorry.

12:28.940 --> 12:30.070
Zhu.

12:30.070 --> 12:32.870
Yaofang, that's not Zhu,
you have got the wrong person.

12:32.870 --> 12:33.930
(Pastry Shop)
That's Zhu.

12:35.360 --> 12:37.870
Zhu, look at me. Zhu.

12:38.390 --> 12:41.510
Don't you recognize your mother anymore?

12:42.190 --> 12:45.720
Yaofang, no. That's not Zhu.

12:45.720 --> 12:48.800
Zhu.

12:51.240 --> 12:54.630
Honey glazed lotus root, steamed buns,

12:56.310 --> 12:57.750
and your favorite tofu pudding.

12:59.630 --> 13:00.830
Don't worry. I won't leave.

13:03.070 --> 13:04.110
Good then.

13:16.630 --> 13:19.310
Jixing, bring the bowl to Zhu.

13:20.480 --> 13:21.680
What do you call me?

13:21.680 --> 13:22.800
Jixing.

13:23.310 --> 13:27.070
Okay, here. The bowl.

13:28.430 --> 13:29.680
Why are you so careless?

13:29.680 --> 13:31.560
You forgot Zhu's favorite bowl.

13:32.720 --> 13:35.510
Wait for me, I'll go get it.
I'll go get it now.

13:36.070 --> 13:37.630
Your father is always careless.

13:41.600 --> 13:44.800
Here, it's your mother
who cherishes you the most.

13:44.800 --> 13:46.390
Zhu likes using this bowl the most.

13:47.950 --> 13:49.190
Your mother remembers it.

13:54.800 --> 13:58.720
It's getting late.
Why don't you go back now?

13:58.720 --> 14:02.040
If you want to visit us next time,
we are always welcome.

14:02.040 --> 14:04.160
What are you talking about?
Where do you want Zhu to go?

14:07.750 --> 14:12.310
Yaofang, you forgot it again.
Zhu has already married.

14:12.310 --> 14:14.600
S-She can't always come back.

14:15.680 --> 14:16.720
Married?

14:21.990 --> 14:24.510
Look at your mouth.

14:24.510 --> 14:25.950
What if I'm not around?

14:31.430 --> 14:32.920
She has married?

14:32.920 --> 14:34.480
- She has married.
- Good.

14:34.480 --> 14:36.040
Right, it's good she's married.

14:39.120 --> 14:40.870
Candied hawthorn.

14:41.680 --> 14:46.040
Jinzhao,
this pastry doesn't look delicious,

14:46.040 --> 14:47.560
but it just tastes really good.

14:48.070 --> 14:50.870
Is it the taste of mother's cooking?

14:53.990 --> 14:55.020
Perhaps.

14:57.480 --> 14:58.630
Shall we come back again?

15:09.160 --> 15:10.240
Don't do this.

15:10.240 --> 15:13.390
Senior, there are so many people here.

15:14.120 --> 15:16.680
Senior, please behave.

15:16.680 --> 15:18.190
Behave, Senior.

15:18.190 --> 15:19.990
Are you asking me to behave?

15:28.430 --> 15:30.870
Guest, I'm sorry, truly sorry.

15:30.870 --> 15:34.750
Well, this dog ran over from the back.

15:35.280 --> 15:37.310
But don't worry.
I'll handle this right away.

15:38.830 --> 15:39.880
Go away.

15:46.070 --> 15:49.070
Didn't you say you are tired
and need to rest? Why are you here

15:50.430 --> 15:51.800
and playing with a dog?

15:58.280 --> 16:00.120
I had enough rest,
so I came out for a stroll.

16:01.560 --> 16:04.480
Since we're here,
let's have a cup of tea.

16:04.480 --> 16:06.390
Sure, after you, Senior.

16:09.950 --> 16:13.240
Why don't you even tell the difference
between a dog and a wolf?

16:29.480 --> 16:33.990
Jinzhao, Jing'an is so beautiful,
with so many delicious foods.

16:34.560 --> 16:36.800
Why do people still
believe in Qiyuan Sect?

16:37.600 --> 16:39.720
Maybe they feel empty inside.

16:40.390 --> 16:41.610
Empty?

16:41.610 --> 16:44.510
Yes, just like
when you woke up three years ago,

16:45.560 --> 16:47.480
everything seemed to be behind a veil,

16:47.480 --> 16:48.520
and had nothing to do with me.

16:49.680 --> 16:52.990
But I've never felt that way.

16:54.630 --> 16:56.310
Because back then you were a fool.

16:58.120 --> 16:59.750
You're the fool.

16:59.750 --> 17:00.830
I haven't finished.

17:01.830 --> 17:03.310
But it's a good thing

17:03.310 --> 17:04.800
I have a fool like you around.

17:06.359 --> 17:08.950
I'm just starting to feel good
about having you around.

17:09.630 --> 17:11.040
Because I don't have time to overthink

17:12.280 --> 17:13.750
while taking care of you every day.

17:15.040 --> 17:19.240
Otherwise, I'd have to believe in
something to fill the emptiness.

17:19.240 --> 17:23.280
Alright, I'll give you this
for complimenting me.

17:25.750 --> 17:26.869
Aren't you hungry?

17:26.869 --> 17:29.600
This is the sweetest piece
I saved for you.

17:30.120 --> 17:31.950
I can't believe you gave me
something delicious.

17:48.040 --> 17:49.430
What?

17:49.430 --> 17:50.720
There's something stuck on your lip.

17:51.310 --> 17:54.070
Didn't you always wipe it off for me?

18:14.120 --> 18:15.280
Is that Luo and Xian Qing?

18:18.720 --> 18:20.430
It seems to be.

18:28.070 --> 18:31.160
Zhaoyan, you don't have
to feel like you owe me.

18:36.070 --> 18:39.800
After all, I had your demonic power
for over twenty years.

18:40.680 --> 18:42.630
I even got you seriously hurt.

18:43.600 --> 18:44.870
I am willing to do it for you.

18:46.360 --> 18:49.750
And I promised you
I wouldn't put my life at risk again.

18:50.590 --> 18:52.390
I have listened to what you said.

19:10.710 --> 19:14.840
Jinzhao, I think it's not appropriate
to peek at them.

19:14.840 --> 19:19.080
We are just doing so
for our friends. Look.

19:24.870 --> 19:28.750
I have things to attend to.
I'd take my leave.

19:30.320 --> 19:31.340
Senior.

19:32.200 --> 19:33.350
Zhaoyan, are you avoiding me?

19:40.960 --> 19:42.590
I thought we've made ourselves clear.

19:44.160 --> 19:46.510
No, I'm not avoiding you.

19:47.390 --> 19:50.200
Then why are you in such a hurry
to leave at the Jiqiao Hall?

19:51.630 --> 19:54.160
Or don't you consider me as a friend?

19:55.440 --> 19:58.350
No way. You are my friend, of course.

20:00.840 --> 20:01.870
Making friends with a demon.

20:02.870 --> 20:06.320
Aren't you afraid of damaging
the Luo family's reputation?

20:07.080 --> 20:11.160
Senior, there's no need
to care about it as we are friends.

20:18.630 --> 20:21.630
I guess I can't invite you
to enjoy the sunset.

20:24.560 --> 20:25.640
I'd leave.

20:41.280 --> 20:43.040
They're leaving. Let's follow them.

20:44.960 --> 20:46.470
You follow Xian Qing,
and I follow Zhaoyan.

20:46.470 --> 20:48.840
Okay, just don't get lost.

20:49.470 --> 20:52.230
It doesn't matter,
as you'll always find me.

20:54.560 --> 20:55.660
Let's go.

20:56.350 --> 20:59.200
Hairpins! Brand new hairpins!

21:05.040 --> 21:06.090
Senior Xian Qing.

21:08.680 --> 21:11.870
Jinzhao, why aren't you with Little Yue?

21:12.440 --> 21:13.960
Aren't you afraid Little Yue

21:14.470 --> 21:16.470
would get lost?

21:17.040 --> 21:18.990
Qi and I have Mindlink.

21:18.990 --> 21:21.470
I could always find her
no matter where she goes.

21:22.110 --> 21:24.870
However, if you don't invite her
to enjoy the sunset in advance,

21:25.870 --> 21:28.470
she would never know.

21:29.960 --> 21:32.680
You were eavesdropping
on my conversation with Zhaoyan?

21:32.680 --> 21:34.200
No. I was just passing by.

21:48.800 --> 21:50.080
Zhaoyan, what a coincidence.

21:51.280 --> 21:52.390
Right, Miss Yue.

21:52.390 --> 21:53.520
Why are you here?

21:54.160 --> 21:58.560
I felt it was too stuffy
in the Zhengwu Alliance,

21:58.560 --> 21:59.590
so I came here.

22:07.920 --> 22:10.800
Miss Yue, why aren't you with Yue?

22:10.800 --> 22:12.920
I don't have to be with him
all the time, right?

22:13.680 --> 22:14.840
Miss Yue, have some tea.

22:18.750 --> 22:19.760
S-Sorry.

22:23.560 --> 22:25.590
It's okay, d-d-don't worry.

22:26.160 --> 22:28.080
Don't worry, I'll take care of it.

22:28.080 --> 22:29.870
You wait here.

22:32.200 --> 22:33.320
Zhaoyan.

22:39.110 --> 22:42.110
If I'm not mistaken,
Luo is actually a lady, right?

22:43.200 --> 22:44.800
How did you figure it out?

22:45.590 --> 22:47.750
We have traveled together
with Luo until now.

22:47.750 --> 22:49.320
Except for that time at Fengyan Inn,

22:49.320 --> 22:52.800
Luo insisted on spending
more money to stay in a single room,

22:52.800 --> 22:54.510
and never bathed with us.

22:54.510 --> 22:57.800
Also, when playing with the dog,
she completely behaved like a lady.

22:59.920 --> 23:02.510
Senior, you have a crush on Luo.

23:04.630 --> 23:07.230
You can't hide the affection
in your eyes.

23:08.560 --> 23:12.880
You also can't hide your affection
to Little Yue.

23:13.390 --> 23:16.110
Senior, could it be that you...

23:17.750 --> 23:19.110
Little Yue is so curious,

23:19.750 --> 23:21.280
so she learns it from you.

23:21.990 --> 23:23.630
Hurry up!

23:25.350 --> 23:26.870
Speak of the devil.

23:28.870 --> 23:29.960
What do you want to do?

23:29.960 --> 23:32.390
Jinzhao, Senior Xian Qing,
something has happened.

23:33.200 --> 23:34.320
What's wrong?

23:34.320 --> 23:35.560
Did something happen to Zhaoyan?

23:36.320 --> 23:38.200
Zhaoyan is a lady.

23:40.840 --> 23:42.870
Okay. How did you know that?

23:46.920 --> 23:49.590
Zhaoyan is not quite like you,

23:49.590 --> 23:51.280
but seems similar to me.

23:56.350 --> 23:59.840
There are some parts you can't touch.

23:59.840 --> 24:01.080
I didn't mean to do it.

24:12.840 --> 24:13.930
Let's go.

24:19.110 --> 24:21.200
Why does Zhaoyan pretend to be a man?

24:21.200 --> 24:22.750
How would I know? Ask her yourself.

24:23.680 --> 24:25.110
Does Miss Ming Xiu know it?

24:25.110 --> 24:26.190
What do you think?

24:27.680 --> 24:29.230
So it's only me and Shifang
who didn't know.

24:30.560 --> 24:32.720
Jinzhao, I can't believe it. You liar.

24:38.390 --> 24:40.750
Director, I have arranged everything.

24:40.750 --> 24:41.750
I have investigated them.

24:48.470 --> 24:51.630
Jinzhao, why didn't you tell me
that Zhaoyan is a lady?

24:52.200 --> 24:53.200
You too, Senior Xian Qing.

24:54.350 --> 24:56.840
I just knew it.
It's all Senior Xian Qing's fault.

24:56.840 --> 24:58.190
What does it have to do with me?

24:58.590 --> 25:02.320
Wait. Fortunately, Zhaoyan is a lady.

25:02.320 --> 25:04.650
Otherwise, Senior Xian Qing,
we would think you are into...

25:05.390 --> 25:07.750
Enough. Okay?

25:07.750 --> 25:10.230
Don't talk nonsense. Stop.

25:11.080 --> 25:14.380
Let's go. Hold on.

25:19.750 --> 25:20.780
Senior.

25:21.390 --> 25:22.630
Huanxing incense.

25:22.630 --> 25:25.840
Wolf demon!
Someone, there's a wolf demon!

25:28.560 --> 25:29.960
Let's go, we'd take him away.

25:29.960 --> 25:31.050
Qi, let's go.

25:36.960 --> 25:38.090
Qiyuan Sect.

25:45.320 --> 25:48.560
Huanxing incense. Terrible!

25:54.080 --> 25:55.510
- Right over there!
- Hurry up!

25:55.510 --> 25:56.680
A wolf demon.

25:56.680 --> 25:57.770
Stop them!

26:21.990 --> 26:24.800
Alliance Leader Zuo, is this
how you treat your guests?

26:26.110 --> 26:28.080
The Zhengwu Alliance never
associates with demons.

26:31.390 --> 26:32.520
A wolf demon

26:34.750 --> 26:36.590
is not a guest of the Zhengwu Alliance.

26:36.590 --> 26:39.560
Alliance Leader, they are harboring
a demon. Let's take them down.

26:39.560 --> 26:40.720
Go!

27:48.510 --> 27:49.610
Uncle.

27:54.440 --> 27:57.110
Qi, how are you? Are you okay?

28:04.230 --> 28:05.360
Senior Xian Qing.

28:09.870 --> 28:11.510
Master Luo, Miss Ming.

28:13.230 --> 28:16.200
Do you also want to make enemies
of the Zhengwu Alliance

28:16.200 --> 28:17.840
and side with the wolf demon?

28:19.230 --> 28:21.920
Master Luo, Miss Ming,
kill this wolf demon.

28:45.200 --> 28:48.350
I knew Master Luo is a righteous person.

28:52.680 --> 28:54.390
I will never allow anyone to hurt him.

29:00.630 --> 29:03.590
Alliance Leader, save the words.
Everyone, let's take them down!

30:05.080 --> 30:06.390
Qi, find a chance to get away.

30:11.920 --> 30:14.920
Stop! Stop fighting!

30:15.920 --> 30:19.210
Stop! Stop fighting!
Jinzhao, stop fighting!

30:19.870 --> 30:21.280
Stop fighting!

30:22.110 --> 30:25.080
Alliance Leader, though
Senior Xian Qing is a demon,

30:25.080 --> 30:27.230
he has been helping us
track down the Qiyuan Sect all along,

30:27.230 --> 30:29.510
and saved us from danger.

30:29.510 --> 30:33.280
Alliance Leader, Senior Xian Qing
is a good demon.

30:34.110 --> 30:35.960
Shifang, move aside.

30:39.110 --> 30:42.560
Alliance Leader Zuo, since Zhengwu
Alliance doesn't associate with demons,

30:42.560 --> 30:44.590
we could just leave.
Why do you have to kill him?

30:46.040 --> 30:49.200
If he's a demon, don't even
think about leaving here today.

30:50.230 --> 30:52.160
I don't allow anyone
to hurt Senior Xian Qing.

30:52.160 --> 30:53.260
Take them all down.

31:18.800 --> 31:19.920
Jinzhao.

31:19.920 --> 31:20.960
Qi.

31:20.960 --> 31:22.000
Jinzhao.

31:34.680 --> 31:36.110
Take Senior Xian Qing away.

31:37.750 --> 31:38.760
Go.

31:41.630 --> 31:44.200
No. I can't run anymore.

31:45.040 --> 31:46.560
I can't run anymore.

31:47.510 --> 31:51.230
Jinzhao, Zhaoyan,
sorry to drag you down.

31:52.470 --> 31:54.200
Don't talk like that to friends.

31:54.200 --> 31:55.960
I'll go ahead and buy us some time.

31:56.590 --> 31:57.770
Please protect Xian Qing.

31:59.320 --> 32:01.990
Then I'll go too,
so you could take Xian Qing away.

32:04.590 --> 32:05.990
Would you like
to be friends with a demon?

32:07.280 --> 32:09.040
You still have the strength
to say such things now.

32:09.040 --> 32:11.200
Shifang told us who you are long ago.

32:11.200 --> 32:12.840
So you've been my friend all along.
Let's go.

32:14.390 --> 32:17.280
Put me down. Just go find Little Yue.

32:17.280 --> 32:18.840
Go ahead, Yue. I'm here.

32:20.470 --> 32:21.480
Come on.

32:23.440 --> 32:24.460
Here you are. Just go.

32:25.590 --> 32:26.760
Then you guys should be careful.

32:31.590 --> 32:34.320
Zhaoyan, sorry to make you worried.

32:34.320 --> 32:35.470
Don't say so, senior.

32:57.800 --> 32:59.870
(Someone released the Huaxing Powder,)

32:59.870 --> 33:02.000
(you would get hurt
if I arrived any later.)

33:02.800 --> 33:07.000
Master, I don't allow anyone
to hurt Senior Xian Qing.

33:23.470 --> 33:24.520
Bian Luohuan.

33:28.870 --> 33:29.960
What are you doing?

