35:18.640 --> 35:21.360
♪About you♪

35:21.360 --> 35:24.660
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

35:25.360 --> 35:28.750
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

35:29.300 --> 35:31.150
