35:31.150 --> 35:33.390
♪I smiled and cried♪

35:33.390 --> 35:38.650
♪For happiness♪

35:38.650 --> 35:42.550
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

35:42.550 --> 35:46.640
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

35:46.640 --> 35:48.590
♪In this tranquil world♪

35:48.590 --> 35:50.640
♪I've finally found you♪

35:50.640 --> 35:54.670
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

35:54.670 --> 35:58.420
♪I've been looking for you♪

35:58.420 --> 36:02.550
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

36:03.380 --> 36:04.820
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

36:04.820 --> 36:07.090
♪I engrave your name♪

36:07.090 --> 36:13.110
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

